title: Kitty
---
Kitty: Oh! You made it across, but the ice bridge collapsed right after you stepped off it!
Kitty: That must've been scary. I'm so glad you're okay.
-> I came to invite you to a party!
    Kitty: A party? That sounds wonderful! I'd love to come and bring my balloons!
    Kitty: But... after you crossed, the ice bridge broke. I can't reach my balloons anymore.
    Kitty: Would you help me gather my balloons from across the water? I'll share my ice magic so you can build paths!
    <<start_quest "Frozen Balloons">>
-> Are you Kitty?
    Kitty: That's me! I live in that little igloo over there, and I love meeting new friends.
    Kitty: I was just worrying about the balloons. They drifted away across the lake...
    -> Can I help you get them back?
        Kitty: Really? That makes me so happy!
        Kitty: If you help me gather the balloons, I'll come for sure. I'll even lend you my ice power!
        <<start_quest "Frozen Balloons">>
-> I'll come back later
    Kitty: I'm glad you're safe, see you in a bit!
===
title: Kitty_InProgress
---
Kitty: Keep going, you're doing great! I'll be waiting for you.
===
title: Kitty_Complete
---
Kitty: You found them all! Thank you so much.
Kitty: I can't wait to come to your party. I'll bring all the balloons!
<<complete_quest "Frozen Balloons">>
===

